 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯名单陆续出炉】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-27/6a15b95a0305enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">摩洛哥世界杯名单：阿什拉夫、布拉欣领衔 恩内斯里、齐耶赫无缘</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/6a15ba676d030.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/6a15ba676d030.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/6a15ba676d030.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">摩洛哥国家队公布了参加本届美加墨世界杯的大名单。阿什拉夫、布拉欣·迪亚斯、马兹拉维等球员均入选，此外18岁里尔中场布阿迪也选择为摩洛哥队出战。恩内斯里、齐耶赫将无缘本届世界杯。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-27/6a15bd0bca143native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">美国世界杯26人名单：普利西奇领衔，小维阿、巴洛贡、麦肯尼入选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605262333153588_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" s