.com/uploads/day_231122/655d952081ef8.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231122/655d952081ef8.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231122/655d952081ef8.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">阿根廷主帅斯卡洛尼接受DSports采访，就梅西的伤情进行了发言。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a15aa3bdc0banative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">惊天反转！皇马B队末轮丢分无缘升级，结束2小时后发现搞错规则了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605262239033080.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605262239033080.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605262239033080.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据西班牙媒体《马卡报》报道，西协甲（西班牙第三级别联赛）末轮升级附加赛名额争夺出现混乱，不同排名规则引发争议，最终皇马B队卡斯蒂利亚获得资格。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a15b20cb6462native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">要价1.5亿！ESPN：小蜘蛛告知马竞，若巴萨和巴黎邀约会选择离队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251105/690a737f7cb14.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251105/690a737f7cb14.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251105/690a737f7cb14.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据ESPN阿根廷报道，阿尔瓦雷斯的经纪人暗示马竞，球员有意在今夏离队。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a15b642ad68bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼城官方：林德斯等5名教练组成员正式离队，祝他们未来一帆风顺</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241127/67470ee3f0ceb.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241127/67470ee3f0ceb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241127/67470ee3f0ceb.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">曼城官方宣布，瓜迪奥拉教练组助教林德斯等5人随着瓜帅的离任也离开了曼城。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/